<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe Dec CPI inflation rises to 16.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe Dec CPI inflation rises to 16.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index rose 3.1 percent in December from November, bringing the year-on-year rate to 16.4 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    Dec 1996    Nov 1996    Dec 1995</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change     +16.4	 +13.9	 +25.8</p>
<p>All-items index		 430.1	 417.3	 369.5</p>
<p>Food-only index		 553.2	 531.4	 488.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100 -- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9.</p>
</text>
